<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello </span>{!Contact.FirstName}<span style="font-size: 12pt;">,&nbsp;</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br>Your account is currently past due&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Case.Past_Due_Balance__c}</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">. To help you avoid late fees we are reaching out about scheduling additional payments to get your account caught up.&nbsp; Are you in the position to make a full or partial payment at this time?</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br>We can run as a lump sum or split up the balance to run on days of your choice. Please let us know which you prefer.</span></span></span></span><br><br><span style="font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Thank you,</span></span></span></span></div><div style=""><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Case.Case_Email_Signature_Name_Formula__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b style="font-size: 14.6667px;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">National Funding, Inc., the parent and servicing company of</span></b><br style="font-size: 14.6667px;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Quick Bridge Funding, LLC</b></span></font></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="font-size: 12pt;">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">P: {!Case.OwnerPhone}&nbsp;| F:&nbsp;</font><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!User.Fax}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">{!Case.Email_Thread_ID__c}</span></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>